nk":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1668646/9a360b66-1687-4880-8757-e367c7d10c75.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1668646/9a360b66-1687-4880-8757-e367c7d10c75.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"🌟 2-Person Shared Room with Balcony in a Beautiful 3-Bedroom Apartment – Leipzig Schönau 🌟\n\nAddress: Kursdorfer Weg 2, 04205 Leipzig\nDistrict: Schönau (City District: West Leipzig)\n\n🏡 About the Apartment\n\nWelcome to your new home in Leipzig-Schönau, one of the city’s most vibrant, green, and central neighborhoods.\nThis furnished 3-bedroom shared apartment (WG) offers a 2-person shared room with a stunning private balcony, perfect for relaxing and enjoying the peaceful surroundings.\n\nThe apartment is shared by 4 occupants in total. You’ll share the room with one friendly roommate, and the kitchen, washroom, and hallway with 2 additional housemates.\n\nApartment Features:\n\n🛏️ 2-person shared room (fully furnished) with balcony access\n\n🪑 Shared kitchen, washroom, and hallway\n\n🧺 Furnished with all essentials: beds, mattresses, pillows, blankets, bedcovers, tables, and storage units\n\n🧑‍🍳 Fully equipped kitchen with refrigerator, oven, washing machine, vacuum cleaner, Wi-Fi router, pots, pans, cutlery, and utensils\n\n🔌 All bills included (electricity, heating, water, internet – fair use clause applies)\n\n📝 Rental contract in your own name\n\n🏙️ Anmeldung possible (city registration)\n\n💶 No processing fee\n\n🕒 Minimum stay: 6 months\n\n📺 Broadcasting fee (ARD/ZDF) to be paid by tenants directly\n\nThis apartment is ideal for students, interns, and working professionals who want a convenient, sociable, and comfortable home in Leipzig.\n\n🌆 Excellent Location – Schönau, Leipzig\n\nThe apartment is located in the beautiful, super-central district of Schönau, at Kursdorfer Weg 2 — one of Leipzig’s most pleasant and well-connected areas.\nYou’re just a few minutes away from the famous Schönauer Park, a perfect green escape for morning jogs, picnics, and relaxation.\n\nPublic Transport:\n\n🚉 Schönauer Ring Train Station is within walking distance, offering direct connections to:\n\nLeipzig Hauptbahnhof (Central Station)\n\nLeipzig University\n\nHTWK Leipzig\n\nLeipzig/Halle Airport\n\nExcellent tram and bus links make commuting across Leipzig simple and fast.\n\nWhether you’re going to the city center, the airport, or university, you’ll enjoy easy, direct connections from your doorstep.\n\n🌿 Neighborhood & Lifestyle\n\nSchönau combines the best of urban living and natural beauty. The area is safe, quiet, and full of amenities, making it ideal for both students and professionals.\n\nNearby you’ll find:\n\n🛒 Supermarkets and shopping centers within walking distance\n\n☕ Cafés, bakeries, and restaurants with international cuisine\n\n🎓 Universities, libraries, and study-friendly cafés\n\n🏞️ Parks and lakes like Schönauer Park and Kulkwitzer See\n\n💪 Gyms, entertainment venues, and cultural centers\n\nThe area’s clean environment, friendly community, and green surroundings make it one of Leipzig’s most desirable neighborhoods to live in.\n\n👩‍🎓 Who Can Apply\n\nStudents, interns, or working professionals\n\nNo age or gender restrictions\n\nClean, respectful, and community-minded tenants preferred\n\n🔑 Summary\n\n✅ 2-person shared furnished room with balcony\n✅ Kursdorfer Weg 2, Leipzig-Schönau – super-central & green district\n✅ Excellent transport links to city center, airport & universities\n✅ All bills included (fair use clause)\n✅ Anmeldung possible\n✅ Minimum stay: 6 months | Notice period: 2 month\n✅ No processing fee\n✅ Safe, quiet, and well-connected neighborhood\n\n🌟 Why Choose This Apartment?\n\nIf you’re looking for an affordable, well-located, and fully equipped shared room in Leipzig, this is the perfect choice.\nEnjoy your private balcony, a friendly international environment, and a convenient connection to everything Leipzig has to offer — all in the beautiful and peaceful Schönau district.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"28"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"other"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"no"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"toilet":{"value":"shared"},"totalSize":{"value":"91"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":29900,"deposit":49900,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"299.00","deposit":"499.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":6,"moveInWindow":15,"currentOccupancy":3,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2027-09-01"}],"updated":"2026-09-14T02:02:11Z","__utId__":"ut1668646"},{"id":"1729352","rank":226,"rating":4.738067322239032,"published":"2026-07-29","kind":2,"kindLabel":"private room","type":3,"typeLabel":"apartment","rentType":"monthly","title":"Königsteinstraße, Leipzig","cancellationPolicy":"30d-mov