s to the city center and main attractions\n\nConvenient commute to universities, workplaces, and shopping centers\n\n🎯 Neighborhood & Lifestyle\n\nThe locality is a safe, peaceful, and lively neighborhood, filled with cultural spots, local markets, and entertainment zones. You’ll find everything you need within walking distance:\n\n🛒 Supermarkets, shopping malls, and pharmacies\n\n☕ Trendy cafes, bakeries, and restaurants\n\n🎭 Art galleries, theaters, and music venues\n\n🌳 Beautiful parks and nearby lakes – perfect for outdoor relaxation\n\nThis area combines urban convenience with a community-friendly atmosphere, making it one of Leipzig’s most desirable places to live.\n\n✨ Why Choose This Apartment?\n\nPrime central location \n\nFully furnished and ready to move in\n\nAll-inclusive rent (no hidden costs)\n\nAnmeldung possible\n\nGreat for students, expats, and professionals\n\nSafe and vibrant neighborhood\n\n📩 Interested?\nContact us today to schedule a viewing or get more details about this private room in a shared 2-bedroom apartment in Leipzig.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"no"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"13"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"other"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"housematesGender":{"value":"shared_w_both"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"shared"},"kitchenware":{"value":"shared"},"livingRoom":{"value":"no"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"no"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"no